{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32599","headline":"秋日山寺怀友人 · 刘沧","name":"秋日山寺怀友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧寺楼台对夕阴，淡烟疎磬散空林。\n风生寒渚白苹动，霜落秋山黄叶深。\n云尽独看晴塞鴈，月明遥听远村砧。\n相思不见又经岁，坐向松窗弹玉琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}